{
  "version": 1,
  "_doc": "Free play on the planet surfaces (src/world/surface_explore.gd, scenes/surface/*_surface.tscn). Per body: how it unlocks in the career (a finished mission of one of `types` at one of `targets`, or `always`), its points of interest (the SurfacePoi nodes placed in the body's scene name them by `id`), the collectibles' facts and the challenges. Texts are i18n keys of i18n/surface_explore_strings.csv; every fact has a `source` (an official page that covers it). `science` is credited once per career (or once per free-play log); in the career research_per_science of it becomes research points. Actions are the rover tools that work at a POI (photo, scan, drill, sample); `reach` is the radius in metres. Challenge types: reach_before (from the challenge node to POI `target` within `time_s`, and before the battery runs out), jump (leave the ramp at the challenge node and stay `air_s` seconds in the air), deliver (a sample from POI `from` to POI `to`), find_all (every POI of the body found), collect_all (every collectible picked up).",
  "research_per_science": 0.5,
